# ==============================================================
# EXERCÍCIO 13 — GET /api/profile — token válido → 200, sem token → 403
# ==============================================================

### EX13 — Criar imposter
POST http://localhost:2525/imposters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "ex13",
  "port": 4013,
  "protocol": "http",
  "stubs": [
    {
      "responses": [
        {
          "is": {
            "statusCode": 200,
            "headers": { "Content-Type": "application/json" },
            "body": {
              "username": "user1",
              "email": "user1@example.com",
              "role": "admin"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "predicates": [
        {
          "equals": {
            "path": "/api/profile",
            "method": "GET",
            "headers": { "Authorization": "Bearer validtoken" }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "responses": [
        {
          "is": {
            "statusCode": 403,
            "headers": { "Content-Type": "application/json" },
            "body": {
              "error": "forbidden"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "predicates": [
        {
          "equals": {
            "path": "/api/profile",
            "method": "GET"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

###

### EX13 — Teste positivo: token válido → 200 + perfil
GET http://localhost:4013/api/profile
Authorization: Bearer validtoken

###

### EX13 — Teste negativo: sem Authorization → 403
GET http://localhost:4013/api/profile

###

### EX13 — Teste negativo: token inválido → 403
GET http://localhost:4013/api/profile
Authorization: Bearer tokeninvalido

###


# ==============================================================
# EXERCÍCIO 14 — POST sem Content-Type: application/json → 415
# ==============================================================

### EX14 — Criar imposter
POST http://localhost:2525/imposters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "ex14",
  "port": 4014,
  "protocol": "http",
  "stubs": [
    {
      "responses": [
        {
          "is": {
            "statusCode": 415,
            "headers": { "Content-Type": "application/json" },
            "body": {
              "error": "unsupported_media_type",
              "message": "O header 'Content-Type: application/json' é obrigatório."
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "predicates": [
        {
          "equals": { "method": "POST" },
          "not": {
            "equals": {
              "headers": { "Content-Type": "application/json" }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

###

### EX14 — Teste: POST com Content-Type errado → 415
POST http://localhost:4014/api/login
Content-Type: text/plain

username=admin&password=secret

###

### EX14 — Teste: POST sem Content-Type → 415
POST http://localhost:4014/api/qualquer

###


